<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>MySooya - Susu Kedelai Segar & Alami</title>
  <meta name="description" content="MySooya: susu kedelai segar tanpa pengawet, dibuat setiap hari. Pesan mudah via WhatsApp.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Nunito+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

  <header class="navbar" id="navbar">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a href="#beranda" class="logo">My<span>Sooya</span></a>
      <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks" aria-label="Navigasi utama">
        <a href="#beranda">Beranda</a>
        <a href="#katalog">Varian Rasa</a>
        <a href="#keunggulan">Keunggulan</a>
        <a href="#kontak">Kontak</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a class="icon-btn" href="https://www.instagram.com/my.sooya_?dlrf=dGxudWN6aGxoamZo" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Instagram MySooya">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        </a>
        <button class="icon-btn cart-btn" id="cartToggle" aria-label="Buka keranjang belanja">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1.5"/><path d="M2 3h3l2.6 12.2a1 1 0 0 0 1 .8h8.8a1 1 0 0 0 1-.8L20 7H6"/></svg>
          <span class="badge" id="cartBadge">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="icon-btn menu-btn" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Buka menu">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="beranda">
      <div class="container hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <span class="tag">🌱 100% Kedelai Alami &amp; Higienis</span>
          <h1>Segarnya Alami, Nutrisi Murni Setiap Hari</h1>
          <p>Susu kedelai segar yang diolah setiap hari tanpa bahan pengawet. Kaya protein nabati, lembut di perut, dan cocok diminum kapan saja untuk menemani aktivitasmu.</p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a href="#katalog" class="btn btn-primary">Pesan Sekarang</a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/6288238715696" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline">Chat WhatsApp</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
          <img src="images/hero-banner.jpg" alt="Botol susu kedelai MySooya" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features" id="keunggulan">
      <div class="container features-grid">
        <div class="feature">
          <span class="feature-icon">🌿</span>
          <h3>100% Bahan Alami</h3>
          <p>Dari kedelai pilihan, tanpa campuran bahan buatan.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <span class="feature-icon">🚫</span>
          <h3>Tanpa Pengawet</h3>
          <p>Murni segar, tanpa pengawet apa pun.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <span class="feature-icon">💪</span>
          <h3>Kaya Protein &amp; Bebas Laktosa</h3>
          <p>Sumber protein nabati yang aman untuk perut sensitif.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <span class="feature-icon">🥛</span>
          <h3>Fresh Daily Made</h3>
          <p>Dibuat setiap hari agar selalu segar saat sampai.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="catalog" id="katalog">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Pilih Varian Rasamu</h2>
          <p>Lima rasa, satu kesegaran yang sama. Tambahkan ke keranjang dan pesan lewat WhatsApp.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product-grid" id="productGrid"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer" id="kontak">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div>
        <a href="#beranda" class="logo logo-light">My<span>Sooya</span></a>
        <p>Susu kedelai segar, alami, dan higienis. Dibuat setiap hari untuk kesehatanmu.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Kontak</h4>
        <p>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/6288238715696" target="_blank" rel="noopener">088238715696</a></p>
        <p>Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/my.sooya_?dlrf=dGxudWN6aGxoamZo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@my.Sooya_</a></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Area Pengiriman</h4>
        <p>Pengiriman tersedia untuk area terdekat. Hubungi kami via WhatsApp untuk memastikan alamatmu terjangkau.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">&copy; <span id="year"></span> MySooya. Semua hak dilindungi.</div>
  </footer>

  <div class="overlay" id="overlay"></div>

  <aside class="drawer" id="cartDrawer" aria-label="Keranjang belanja" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="drawer-head">
      <h3>Keranjang Belanja</h3>
      <button class="icon-btn" id="cartClose" aria-label="Tutup keranjang">&#10005;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="drawer-body">
      <div id="cartItems" class="cart-items"></div>
      <div class="cart-total" id="cartTotalRow">
        <span>Total</span>
        <strong id="cartTotal">Rp 0</strong>
      </div>
      <form id="checkoutForm" class="checkout-form" novalidate>
        <h4>Data Pemesan</h4>
        <label for="customerName">Nama Pemesan *</label>
        <input type="text" id="customerName" placeholder="Nama lengkap" autocomplete="name">
        <label for="customerAddress">Alamat Pengiriman *</label>
        <textarea id="customerAddress" rows="3" placeholder="Alamat lengkap pengiriman" autocomplete="street-address"></textarea>
        <label for="customerNote">Catatan Tambahan</label>
        <textarea id="customerNote" rows="2" placeholder="Contoh: kurangi dingin, antar sore hari"></textarea>
        <p class="form-error" id="formError" role="alert"></p>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Checkout via WhatsApp</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
